{"id":499,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"地域課題に向き合う公立中高一貫校","feature_description":"福山市立福山中学校は、広島県東部で最初の併設型公立中高一貫教育校として、中高6年間の学びを行います。学校は第Ⅴ期ビジョンを掲げ、地域や社会に働きかけて課題を発見し、よりよい価値の創造に向けて努力する生徒の育成を目指しています。学習を地域・社会との関わりにつなげ、主体的に考え、協働して行動する力を育てる教育方針です。実践を大切にします。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3696,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.fukuyama.hiroshima.jp/kou-ichifuku/gaiyou/gaiyou.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-15","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3697,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.fukuyama.hiroshima.jp/kou-ichifuku/gaiyou/gaiyou.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-15","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
